        "fix: [taal] in 'opstyg en land en mense inklim': The run of 'en ... en' in the glossary definition blurs which clause 'mense inklim' belongs to.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Vrag wat haastig is': Block heading: cargo cannot itself be 'haastig'; something like cargo that must arrive quickly is meant. Left unchanged because a heading may be the block's key; for the writer to judge.",
